# DrumMania V2 (drmnv2j, revision 2005-11-28, Konami Python 2): power-on from the dumps' disk and
# NVRAM. Boot program 2.2.0 brings the network up (runtime/python/ethnet.h), finds no update server,
# then starts the disk's newer boot program, which starts F02-JA 20051128-0. The session check
# (no GuitarFreaks) gives up, then attract: BEMANI EXPO, the title (INSERT COINS), HIT CHART and the
# first demo play (リライト).
game drmnv2j

from 0 every 600 snap
at 14400 quit
